## 8. Reliability, Scaling & Disaster Recovery Strategy

1. **High Availability & Redundancy:**
   - Active-active redundant ingress load balancing across multiple availability zones.
   - Database read-replicas offload read traffic with synchronous primary failover.
2. **Backpressure & Decoupling:**
   - Kafka event buffers decouple upstream traffic spikes from downstream persistence workers.
3. **Resilience & Fault Tolerance:**
   - Circuit breakers (Hystrix / Resilience4j pattern) prevent cascading service degradation.
   - Exponential backoff with jitter on transient failures.
